From 6c5dff4138b5386bbcdd14dd3576f6da900ed13b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:59:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD reviewed-feature confirmation for patch chats

Patch agents need an explicit terminal decision point after review because accepted review output can either finish the feature or send the agent back for follow-up. Completed reviews append a reusable feature-done prompt to the reviewed chat, select that patch agent, and let the terminal hide the chat on yes while any other response reopens and forwards the message for continued work.
