+again. When the selected patch-agent chat is idle and its last non-empty line is
+`FEATURE_DONE_PROMPT`, a `yes` chat response hides that agent chat from the left pane. Any other
+response clears the hidden state for that agent and sends the text back through
+`WorkLeafController::send_message`, so the patch agent can continue from the reviewed state.
 
